<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Vapaa Venäjä (Finnish Red Guards)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1918</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">My Comrade in Death Throes (Ion Degen)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1944</span><span class="sg-chain-h">poem set to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Rozszumiały się wierzby płaczące (Roman Ślęzak)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1939–1945</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new Polish words to the same melody (resistance song)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ben Gvulot (Haim Hefer, for the Palmach)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1945</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new Hebrew words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Soviet words</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1941; 1967 (A. Fedotov)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Words by Vladimir Lazarev</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1984</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Version of the constitutional crisis</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1993</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">White Army version (Andrei Mingalyov)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">after 1991</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Anthem of Tambov Oblast (words by A. Mitrofanov)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2002</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Words by Andrey Kandaurov</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2026</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the same melody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Cranes Are Flying (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1957</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">At Home Among Strangers (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1974</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in (instrumental)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Raspad (film)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1990</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in (instrumental)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Charlie Wilson's War (film)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li></ul></section>
